Program-specific data
---------------------

This package intentionally contains no ORCA or Gaussian parameter tables or
reference probe data.  Such presets are supplied by the caller as
`ruaa_dft_grids::preset::GridPreset` data; the published crate only provides
the program-independent construction machinery, the PySCF preset and the
mathematical rules.
